.680" end="01:47.680">I... I really wish these snakes were your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.990" end="01:52.490" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.080" end="02:00.080">I... I really wish you should make up your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.900" end="02:09.900">I... know... know... know... know... know...</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.830" end="02:29.830" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.090" end="02:44.090">I... I really wish these snakes were your arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.770" end="02:48.270" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.080" end="02:56.080">I... I really wish you'd make up your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.650" end="03:00.650">I... know... know... know...</p></div></body></tt>